    <Placemark>
      <name>Wreck Room Underground</name>
      <styleUrl>#serious</styleUrl>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>Status:</b> Serious room / anchor<br/><b>Address:</b> 9975 Wadsworth Pkwy, Westminster, CO 80021<br/><br/>32 tables including nine 12-foot tables, bar, good food, billiard hall vibe; $10/hour, $5 after 5pm Sundays. Sunday deal requires current confirmation.<br/><br/><a href="https://wreckroomunderground.com/">Website/Source</a><br/>Reviewed 2026-10-26.<br/><b>Coordinates:</b> ArcGIS World Geocoder, street-address match, 2026-10-26. Approximate interpolated street-address location; not a verified building entrance.]]></description>
