      <styleUrl>#serious</styleUrl>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>Status:</b> Serious room / anchor<br/><b>Address:</b> 380 Main St, Longmont, CO 80501<br/><br/>thirty-plus tables, casual room, $1/hour weekday before 5pm, $4/hour after 5pm and weekends; hourly rate requires current confirmation. A public/legacy listing references an older Pharaoh&#x27;s location at 10001 Pharo Chase Way, Longmont.<br/><br/><a href="https://pharaohsbilliards.com/">Website/Source</a><br/>Reviewed 2026-10-26.<br/><b>Coordinates:</b> ArcGIS World Geocoder, street-address match, 2026-10-26. Approximate interpolated street-address location; not a verified building entrance.]]></description>
